    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT23_INTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "#": "由 翼德大大 编写",
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I love those cute sunflowers!",
              "zh": "我喜欢那些可爱的向日葵！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SHOUT",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "I want to plant them to the left!",
              "zh": "我要把它们种在后排！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Chill down, User Dave. It is often not beneficial doing this.",
              "zh": "冷静，用户戴夫。这样做通常不是一个好的选择。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "The simulation shows that planting them to the right will make your defense more stable.",
              "zh": "模拟结果显示将向日葵种在前方可以更好地稳住阵脚。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "But I don't want them to be hurt...",
              "zh": "可我不想看到它们受伤……"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "This is necessary sacrifice, User Dave.",
              "zh": "这是必要的牺牲，用户戴夫。"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT23_INTRO2"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "The simulation shows that planting them to the right will make your defense more stable.",
              "zh": "模拟结果显示将向日葵种在前方可以更好地稳住阵脚。"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "This is necessary sacrifice.",
              "zh": "这是必要的牺牲。"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "aliases": [
        "NEW_EGYPT23_OUTRO"
      ],
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "#": "由 SansGrinder 编写",
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "According to statistics, our sunflowers produces their first sun after 5-10s when planted",
              "zh": "根据我的统计信息，我们的向日葵会在种下5-10秒内产出第一颗阳光"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "PLAYFUL",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "WHOA! I can't even finish 5 tacos in 10 seconds!",
              "zh": "哇偶！10秒都不够我吃5个玉米卷的！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "TIRED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "......",
              "zh": "......"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Anyways, that means you should almost always plant a sunflower as soon as it is off cooldown! ",
              "zh": "言归正传，这意味着大多数情况下，你应该在向日葵冷却结束后尽快种植新的向日葵！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "And as long as the sunflower survives around 10 seconds, we practically got a sunflower for free, right?",
              "zh": "那只要向日葵能活10秒左右，我们是不是相当于获得了一颗免费的向日葵？"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "EXCITED",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Precisely! Not to mention, most of the time the sunflower could survive until another sun production, earning us extra sun along with the flower",
              "zh": "的确！何况多数时候向日葵能生产不止一次，这样我们既获得了额外阳光，也获得了额外向日葵"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "PLAYFUL",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "Wahaha, let's send all our sunproducers in the frontline, and obtain free solar power!",
              "zh": "哇哈哈，我们把所有向日葵都送上前线吧！免费光能我来啦！"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_EXIT"
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "en": "......",
              "zh": "……"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
